      "short": "Simon, since $3000\\text{ cm}\\div60\\text{ cm}=50$ stick lengths.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}30\\text{ m}&=30\\times100\\text{ cm}\\\\&=3000\\text{ cm}\\\\\\text{Number of stick lengths}&=3000\\div60\\\\&=50\\end{align*}$$\nSimon used 50 stick lengths, so his stick was 60 cm long.",
